37	121	\N	2023-12-16 12:24:40.76	51.67	[{"id": 1, "kind": "121", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/40/SESSION_121_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "10-05-2024 14:02:51", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Francais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;Le travail devient un axe de pr&eacute;sence ou de r&eacute;pr&eacute;sentation de l'Homme dans la vie. En fait, &agrave; nos jours, le nombre d'heurs pass&eacute; au travail est &eacute;norme par rapport &agrave; cel pass&eacute; &agrave; l'exet&eacute;rieur (en famille, &agrave; la maison...) . Le code du travail a pens&eacute; &agrave; ce point et a adopt&eacute; "la Qualit&eacute; de Vie et les Conditions de Travail" QVCT. Comment garantir aux employ&eacute;s cette qualit&eacute; de vie au travail?&nbsp; Nous commen&ccedil;ons par montrer l'importance de la psycologie de l'Homme. Apr&eacute;s, nous ponsons aux droits de l'Homme. Et, nous terminons par une conclusion.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; La psycologie de l'Homme est tr&eacute;s imporante pour son bien &ecirc;tre et a une grande influence m&ecirc;me sur sa sant&eacute;. En plus, prendre en consid&eacute;ration cet aspect repond &agrave; l'objectif 3&nbsp; des objectifs de d&eacute;v&eacute;loppments durables . L'environnement du travail soit de point de vue social comme les comportements de diff&eacute;rents coll&eacute;gues, le partage et la notion d'&eacute;quipe&nbsp; soit de point de vue mat&eacute;riel comme le local les &eacute;quipements sont un enjeu majeur. En outre, les situations de travail , par exemple travailler dans son domaine d'expertise offre le confort &agrave; l'emply&eacute;. Sa maitrise de certaines notions l'aide &agrave; &eacute;voluer rapidement et &agrave; s'integrer dans la soci&eacute;t&eacute;.</p>\n<p>En revenche, les droits de l'Homme respecter par la soci&eacute;te peuvent &ecirc;tre tr&eacute;s int&eacute;ressants. Par exemple, l'ASSURANCE , grantir son droit aux m&eacute;dicaments offrent aux employ&eacute;s un point de confort qu'ils aident &agrave; aimer leurs travails et parsuite, devenir plus &eacute;panui&eacute;s et plus pationn&eacute;s.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; Donc, l'environnement, la vie interne , les droits de l'Homme respect&eacute;s par l'entreprise peuvent garantir la qualit&eacute; de vie de travail. Utliser le mode de travail hybride c'est &agrave; dire encourager le&nbsp; travail &agrave; domicile peut il garantir de plus ce QVCT?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
48	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:13:38.155	40.67	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/51/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "17-05-2024 12:09:09", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Engineering is a job that makes our world better and better by searching and developing new ideas and projects.Nowdays, some people thought that this job have wicked problems regarding to the rapid updates of technologies and the world situation that's why the engineer needs to be equipped with aa new set competences.In the other side , others believe that the engineer is a person who has a generic job , he is responsable of excuting specific tasks and make them functional.</p>\n<p>To argue this article we will ask the question What is&nbsp; an engineer?</p>\n<p>To reply to this question , first of all , the engineer must have a several competences and especially the soft skills such as taking risks and leadership , this competences will make him a productive employee who had solutions to all the company problems. Second , by the revolution of the artificial intelligence , what makes the difference between two engineers is the innovation . For that to make your exictency in the society , you should be part of the challenges and be always updated.Third , if an engineer still think that he is just excutive , he will be replaced by the future generation of engineers, whom taked many innovated ideas and subjects.</p>\n<p>In the other part , in each company we have several posts , there are employees responsable of making decision and give orders and tasks to other ones . So we can find some engineers taking just tasks and excuting them.Also , to be a success engineer you can just do your job perfecly without mistakes , you respect the deadlines of your tasks without dealing with society issues and espacially without risks.</p>\n<p>Finally to conclure , some people think that world revolution will make this job harder and facing complexe problems . But others think that the engineer can deal with this problems by just doing his job perfecly without innovation , without challenges and without new set of competences.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
