25	2112	\N	2024-02-19 16:14:03.415	67.75	[{"id": 1, "kind": "2112", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/28/SESSION_2112_1.pdf", "size": "320.02 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "19-02-2024 16:14:03", "dateUpload": "18-02-2024 20:24:11", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Capsule-EN-Details.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 2, "kind": "2112", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/28/SESSION_2112_2.mp4", "size": "48993.48 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "19-02-2024 16:14:03", "dateUpload": "18-02-2024 20:25:57", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "CapsuleEN-CoreData ‐ Réalisée avec Clipchamp.mp4", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
16	121	\N	2023-12-16 12:36:06.533	65.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "121", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/18/SESSION_121_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "10-05-2024 13:57:31", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Francais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Le d&eacute;veloppement durable est devenu aujourd'hui un enjeu majeur dans la r&eacute;ussite de l'entreprise sur les plans environnementaux, economiques et sociaux. Parmi les &eacute;l&eacute;ments essentielles qui aide &agrave; ce d&eacute;veoloppement, on peut citer la gestion des ressources humaines. En effet, la fonction RH a des effets positifs qui aide au d&eacute;veloppement de l'entreprise. c'est dans ce contexte se situe notre probl&eacute;matique. Comment la gestion des ressources humaines peut contribuer positivement pour am&eacute;liorer la qualit&eacute; du travail au sein d'une entreprise?</p>\n<p>Premi&egrave;rement, la fonction RH peut organiser des formations pour am&eacute;liorer les comp&eacute;tances de leurs employ&eacute;s dans leurs domaines d'expertise ce qui aide &agrave; augmenter leur rendement et peut am&eacute;liorer l'&eacute;conomie de l'entreprise. Par exemple, si on parle d'une entreprise sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;e en d&eacute;veloppement des logiciels informatiques, la RH peut planifier des formations sur l'optimisation des algorithmes. Ce type de formation peut aider &agrave; diminuer l'utilisation de l'&eacute;nergie en optimisant le code des applications r&eacute;lis&eacute;es am&eacute;iorant ainsi l'&eacute;conomie de l'entreprise.</p>\n<p>Sur le plan social, La RH peut &eacute;galement organiser d'autres type de formations individuelle adapt&eacute;e selon le besoin de chaque employ&eacute; pour atteindre &agrave; la fin des profils id&eacute;als. Cela peut aider &agrave; diminuer l'in&eacute;galit&eacute; entre les employ&eacute;s. De plus, elle peut inclure ses employ&eacute;s dans un groupe maladie d'assurances ou int&eacute;grer un medecin de travail dans l'entreprise, ce qui peut am&eacute;liorer la bonne sant&eacute; et le bien &ecirc;tre au travail.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>En conclusion, La gestion des ressources humaine est un &eacute;l&eacute;ment essentielle dans la r&eacute;ussite et le d&eacute;veoppement d'une entreprise que ce soit sur le plan&nbsp;social, environnmental ou &eacute;conomique. Cependant, dans les perspectives, plusieurs questions peuvent se poser: quels sont les autres fonctions qui peuvent &ecirc;tre consid&eacute;rer comme &eacute;l&eacute;ments essentiels pour le d&eacute;veploppement d'une entreprise? Est ce qu'on peut consid&eacute;rer que la RH peut &eacute;galement avoir des effets n&eacute;gatifs dur la soci&eacute;t&eacute; et l'environnement dans d'autres conditions?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
18	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:37:10.272	64.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/20/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "13-05-2024 10:27:55", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>BEGIN:</p>\n<p>Nowadays, seventy five percent (75%) of workers in potential jobs in business organisations have STEM-based qualifications. Indeed, Advanced technologies such as AI, deepl learning and machine learning play a crucial role in various fileds and affect directly human being.</p>\n<p>Some people advocate that AI-based systems will positively affect jobs targets, employement relationship and users experience in advanced market environment. Onother group think that same fileds could be destroyed by this massive use of AI-based systems hence those systems will increase the number of unemployed people. A third group confirm that we can balance between very high technology and market enviroment by the correct use of AI&nbsp; and by controlling it using rules and ethics.</p>\n<p>First, AI is considered as a jump in the technology and it transform the meangfulness of jobs by changing the manner how it's done, by making some tasks easier, Also, AI reduces time, power and costs which can encourage technical innovation and competition .&nbsp;The creator of the Wolrd Wide Web WWW said that "the technology that we see today is nothing of what we are expecting in the future", which make the defender of AI confirm that all business organisations should be updated with the advanced technologies. Sothat it can be a good competitor in the market environment.</p>\n<p>However, another group based on the sentence that says:" The technology is best when it brings all people together", they consider that the AI increase the gap between various jobs in various domains. Furthermore, AI using the very high technology could kill human creativity and hand made jobs. By talking about humanity side, relationship between employer-employee could be also decreased becuase of huge use of AI and direct communication would be abscent. Also, the defend people who didn't have the basic material and architecture to use technology.</p>\n<p>Concluding this debate, the use of AI based systems in business organizations like any thing in the wolrd has its benefits and its drawbacks, using AI is very important but under some rules and conditions</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
