9	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:19:01.929	37.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/11/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "17-05-2024 12:21:36", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; The Artificial Intelligence or AI, is changing how we work. This essay looks at the good and not so good parts of using AI in work.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; The emergence of AI-based systems in the businness organisations will significantly transform work. AI can transform working special for each employee. It can understand who each of us works and give us exactelly what to need to get better. For exemple, some smart programs in the business organisations can work much well, like an employee.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; But some people worry that if we use too much AI, working might feel less frindly, computers can't understand feeling like humains do.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; Also, not everyone has the same access to this funcy tools to work. To make the best to both words, we can use AI to help us work but not foget the good thinks that relationship get.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; So, AI-based systems can make working super cool but we need to be careful. Let's use technology like as a helper, not a boss. That way, everyone can have a chance to work and fell good about it.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
