1	111	\N	\N	0.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "111", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/3/SESSION_111_1.pdf", "size": "0 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": null, "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "QCMProduction.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 2, "kind": "111", "path": "https://grade.esprit.tn/webservice/pluginfile.php/10297/mod_resource/content/1/Template%20Descriptif%20QCM.pdf/?forcedownload=1&token=d1d32de402aa7927638bfca5d0fa6b64", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": null, "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Template Descriptif QCM.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 3, "kind": "111", "path": "https://grade.esprit.tn/webservice/pluginfile.php/10298/mod_resource/content/1/Syllabus-FOM2-2022-2023.docx.pdf/?forcedownload=1&token=d1d32de402aa7927638bfca5d0fa6b64", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": null, "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Syllabus-FOM2-2022-2023.docx.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
1	122	\N	2024-04-18 11:04:57.285	64.17	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/3/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "05-07-2024 07:00:37", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p><strong>START</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Emerging to AI-based system is a revolutionary realization that is changing the mindset of peoples and giving a new vision to a future&nbsp; full of challenges.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>These challenges can interfere in different fields and in our daily life causing a major progress and change in the way of living, thinking, working and proceeding in different steps in our lives.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>This emergence will basically affect different fields and will make transformation in, for example, the &nbsp;work force demographics of a job as well as its nature and its meningfulness. For example, the AI-based solution can replace some employees in doing some functionalities or it can interfere in evaluating the results of a work done by humans. This interaction can be considered positive to enhance the requested task or to propose new ideas that can make progress in certain points.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Also it can replace human in doing so many tasks in which the intelligent machine can generate results so easily based on the choice of a specific target, also it can raise the awarness of customers and make them so selective in their choice and this will create a competitive environment.</strong></p>\n<p><strong> Despite, its usefulness in some aspects, it can cause a problem for future generations in the business organisations. They are forced to adapt themselves and their business&nbsp; so they can be able to create new opportunities, keep growing and not being affected negatively by this evolution.</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>The AI in general complements human help him to grow&nbsp; but cannot fully replace him.</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>END</strong></p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
