15	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:35:35.249	64.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/17/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "05-07-2024 07:19:56", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p><strong>Start</strong></p>\n<p>Now, we use the AI in many area in social life, medecine, education, business organisations and more. Many business organisations, especially the big brands like Netflix, Amazon and Alibaba use AI-based systems and integrate many fonctionality of that technology to first improve the satisfaction of the costumers and second the relationship beteween their employees. Those organisation are used a system of recomandation to improve the experience of the customer.</p>\n<p>Due to the need of the word, the business organisations improve its products using AI-based systems. For example, if we talk about an organisation like an hospital need to use a system of emergency based on IOT to save the life of many peaple. The IOT need a system of data warhouse to stock and implement the data in order take a decision at time. This data must be analysed and predicted using another technology based on AI in order to help the staff in the hospital.</p>\n<p>In each day, the organisations collect million of data that used to improve the experience of its customers and the work. Those organisations must have a server to stock and save this massive data. Due to the cost of maintenace and its owner server, they need to use AI-based systems to use the cloud which is an infrastructure offered by many brands like Google Cloud Platform, Microsoft Azure and AWS. Those business organisations use those infrstructures remotly based on the AI and<em> it pay as it need</em>. The organisations that use this technology will be more competitive.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We can see now a self driven-car in the word, the technology that used is based on the AI systems. Imagine, if all the car are self drive then&nbsp; this technology first help the organisation to win money and second save the life of the driver and save the environment due to pollution.</p>\n<p>Many organisations use drones for the delevery to the customers which improve the relationship between the organisation and its customers. We can see now some organisaations use robots and implement robotics, those robots interact with peaple and do many tasks like humain.</p>\n<p>Finally, the AI-based systems help to create new jobs and also destroy many old job, but it help to delivere a good product and improve the relationship between employer and employee, relationship between people and technology and save the environment.</p>\n<p><strong>End</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
20	2112	\N	2024-05-30 14:58:09.893	52.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "2112", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/22/SESSION_2112_1.mp4", "size": "449793.48 kb", "shown": false, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "30-05-2024 14:58:09", "dateUpload": "30-05-2024 14:57:31", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "english capsule.mp4", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 2, "kind": "2112", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/22/SESSION_2112_2.pdf", "size": "154.8 kb", "shown": false, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "30-05-2024 14:58:09", "dateUpload": "30-05-2024 14:58:04", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "description.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
