7	2111	\N	2024-05-31 09:33:48.971	74.50	[{"id": 2, "kind": "2111", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/9/SESSION_2111_2.mp4", "size": "220997.94 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "31-05-2024 09:33:48", "dateUpload": "30-05-2024 11:03:58", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "capsule_MarwaAMMAR_Fr.mp4", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
25	122	\N	2024-04-18 11:01:05.121	66.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/28/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "17-05-2024 11:31:06", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Joe Rogan, The podcaster invited Elon Musk to talk about innovative systems, Tesla and SpaceX. When asked about Ai, Elon said "Artifial Intellegence still dangerous". At the start of 2023, OpenAI, showed the world a new intellegence, never been before which is ChatGPT. Beyond the amaziness, everybody was worried about the future. Since that, we always arguing between the fact that the machine will replace the humain, and the fact that the AI is supporting us doing our jobs.</p>\n<p>Clqssic jobs demanding effortless tasks with end by the end of 2023, AI is here to do the humain job, the cheapest way possible. Withing OpenAI tool, 40$ are enough to create files, organising, supporting, emailing the customer and maintaining businesses. For exemple, content creators lost their communities due to the AI-Based content. Everybody can deploy his own content using only three AI tools, ChatGPT for transcripting a podcast, text to speech AI and an AI to create a video from the keywords spelled during the audio.</p>\n<p>The Pro-AI communities continue pushing to create a tool for every single task to support the humain doing their duty, even the big farms like Google, Meta and Amazon are developing their AI bots to help customers within different stuff. Companies always thinking about profits but are they thinking about the outcomes ? we don't think so. Engineers and developers using AI as a support to help them reach their goals avoiding the repetitive tasks, but the fact to use the AI rendering without really understanding the usage of the technologie will return as negative habits. As a result, nowadays engineering have less competences than older ones.</p>\n<p>The number AI-based systems increase everyday for different fields such as technologie, finance even in industrial fields which causes a rise of the number of unemployability. On the other hand, AI make people weak in term of innovation, Design thinking and crisis resolving.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>AI can be helpful to complete come daily tasks but the consequence of its usage still nagative. but is this all Elon was worried about ? was he thinking about world wide control ? The real danger will rise when an AI can be born by another AI.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
