45	122	\N	2023-12-16 11:39:45.354	9.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/48/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "05-07-2024 07:32:53", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>The&nbsp; emergence of AI based systems in the businness organisations will significantly transform work force demographics, nature and meaningfulness of jobs, employee relationship between people and technology, customer esperience and competivie advantage within dynamic market environment</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
