48	2112	\N	2024-02-18 22:35:24.54	70.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "2112", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/51/SESSION_2112_1.mp4", "size": "93016.35 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "18-02-2024 22:35:24", "dateUpload": "18-02-2024 22:30:51", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Capsule Angular(Data binding).mp4", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 2, "kind": "2112", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/51/SESSION_2112_2.pdf", "size": "153.21 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "18-02-2024 22:35:24", "dateUpload": "18-02-2024 22:34:54", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Production-Pédagogique_Capsules_Vidéo-Abdellaoui-Nader.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
14	121	\N	2023-12-16 12:11:47.033	27.67	[{"id": 1, "kind": "121", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/16/SESSION_121_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "05-07-2024 07:15:46", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Francais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Dans nos jours la gestion des ressorces humaines et le developpement durable en entreprise</p>\n<p>&nbsp;deux facteurs li&eacute;es et important dans le monde.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Notamment, Le developpement durable est essentielle&nbsp; dans les entreprises, le developpement durable am&eacute;liore les perfermances&nbsp;</p>\n<p>et la productivit&eacute; de l'entreprise et elle aussi des effets positives sur les envirenements et l'etre humain.</p>\n<p>il cr&eacute;&eacute; des nouveaux travail et am&eacute;liore les traveaux existent,&nbsp; il aide les gents de travailler intelligement et non plus durement.</p>\n<p>le developpement durable un facteur n&eacute;cessaire dans les &eacute;coles&nbsp; en d&eacute;veloppant les comp&eacute;tences</p>\n<p>des employ&eacute;s et meme am&eacute;liore la qualit&eacute; de la formation.</p>\n<p>de plus le developpement durable a un effet tres importants&nbsp; sur l 'envirenement et la vie quotidienne, pr exemple on trouve des soci&eacute;tes&nbsp;</p>\n<p>aujourdhui elle cr&eacute;e des produits pour les plantes en se basant sur le developpement durable.</p>\n<p>il est important de noter, que le d&eacute;veloppement durable, un facteur important d'amilorer, et de r&eacute;ussir.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
12	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:39:24.33	49.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/14/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "13-05-2024 10:16:44", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Pervasive technology makes life more and more complexe. Especially various social issues apprear and come the role of the engineer to solve them. These problems are too complex and multifaceted that a technical innovation will not be able to resolve. Thus future generations of engineers need to be equipped with new set of advanced competencies. They will need to apply a holistic view, considering concepts such as context, complexity, uncertainty, risk or ethics.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; To solve future complex problems, future engineers should be able to adopt a holistic view of the issue. A holistic view analyses the different spacial and temporal deep levels of problem effects. For example a technical supervision solution used to supervise employees and increase productivity in some context, may have impact on their productivity by inducing more stress, and ethics concerns in another context.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The holistic view requires adopting multi-disciplinary approache. In fact an economic solution may impact negativelly the environment and/or the society.</p>\n<p>Ability to make critical view are also required.</p>\n<p>Finally predictive view is required as it makes a perspective on future effects.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;It becomes clearer that future generations of engineers need to be equipped with advanced competencies such as holistic view, multi disciplinary, critical and predictive view in order to be able to resolve future social issues. Such competencies require new approches in higher education to support the developement of these advanced competencies. Thus the hole education system should be revised and adapted.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
42	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:11:09.137	35.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/45/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "17-05-2024 11:57:25", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>The emergence of AI-based systems in the business organisations will significantly transform work force demographics, nature and meaningfulness of jobs, employer-employee relationship, relationship between people and technology, customer experience and competitive advantage within dynamic market environment.</p>\n<p>Nowadays, we live in world which machine can replace human and can do the same thing that employer can do and sometimes better than the employer.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>So, this will reduce the nombre of employees in entreprise and day to day, we can see a succes entreprise with no human employees but based in AI systems.</p>\n<p>In my opinion, I agree about the importance of AI Based systems and how it can a succes entreprise but the machine did not replace human and we can not talking about a succes entreprise without talking about the relationship between his employees and how each employe is responsible.</p>\n<p>Finaly, I think that the future enginners need to be equipped with a new set of competence to having just the advantage of AI-based Systems and do never let the AI replace human.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
