22	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:35:32.44	14.67	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/25/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "17-05-2024 11:29:15", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>To day 80% of our natural ressources are consumed by 20% of people, so the impact of technologies is so important in our new model of life, technologies facilitate our life and give people opportunities to progress and discover a new competences but also we should take care of our enviromment, specially employee don't need to have only technical competence but also they should have an idea about sustainable development.</p>\n<p>First, a new model of sustainable development in the business organisations should transform work and give employee an equitable access to organisation ressources, so it ensure a good relationship between the employer and the employee.</p>\n<p>Also, the business organisation that respect the environnement by using sustainable energy can provide a good experience to all employee.</p>\n<p>But, we should not forget that the implementation of this new model of sustainable developpment needs an imprtant budget and a cooperation between organisation and employee.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
