105	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:43:11.497	49.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\19\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 20:23:53", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>There is no doubt that the potentiel use of smartphones&nbsp; increases in exponetiel courb, which impact the process of communication, the access of information and also the entertaiment tools. But, this revolution has many drawbacks . This essay well explore the advantages and challenges of smartphones, along with strategies to overcomming its drawbacks.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>On the one hand, smartphones improve interpersonal relationships specially people in remote areas. Morover, the access in information has very fast by using this technologie.For isntance, many students use smartphones more then laptops. Also, smartphones can be used like entertainment tools by playing games.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>On the other hand, the over using of smartphones enhance many disadvanteges like addiction and overlapping between interpersonal relationships and professional environments.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>While this concerns are valid, many potentiel strategies can be used to reduce the disadvantages of smartphones. For instance, controle the use of smartphone by children.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In conclusion, while smartphones have many benefits like increase the access of information and improve the communication between poeple, they also have many challenges like addiction. To balance the use of this technologie, user should control them self.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
