125	21212	\N	2025-02-17 06:44:39.018	74.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "21212", "path": "2\\\\17\\\\SESSION_21212_1.mp4", "size": "161327.8 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "17-02-2025 06:44:39", "dateUpload": "17-02-2025 00:16:15", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Séquence_Enseignement_Enregistrée_Hamdi_Braiek.mp4", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 2, "kind": "21212", "path": "2\\\\17\\\\SESSION_21212_2.pdf", "size": "98.22 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "17-02-2025 06:44:39", "dateUpload": "17-02-2025 06:22:18", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Rapport_Séquence_Enseignement_Enregistrée_Hamdi_Braiek.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
92	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:46:26.042	71.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\152\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 12:15:47", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>The pervasive computing, particulary the increase use of smartphones, presents a concept that gained a particular attention in last decades. It is defined as a technological development that meets the needs of the person anywhere anytime without any efforts. However, this concept requieres reconciling two conflicting goals: the well being and the dangerous addiction. While some argue that smart technologies as pervasive tools are standards in our daily life in order to make it more easier , others see that the revolutionized way of using them is the reason of being addicted and&nbsp; having dangerous results for healthcare, relashionships and professional environments. How this idea is correct?</p>\n<p>Propnents of using smartphones argue that this technologie is a fundamental driver for development. It leads to increased productivity and poverty reduction which are crucial for job creation , enhancing the life quality and open communication with other religions. By using smartphones in the world aroud us, the user can feel like he is in a small home where he can do searaching, change ideas, share emotions and comptences anytimes an d anywhere.&nbsp;Thereby, creating a solid foundation for social well being. Furthermore, the pervasive presence of smartphone in our daily lives leads countries to invest in the development of relationships as practising langages, traditions organising trips to discover the other word.From this view, we can say that the benifices of smart technologies can coexist if managed correctly by the user.</p>\n<p>On the other hand, critics see that the huge use of this pervasive tool without control presents a big dangerous for professional and social relashionships. Spending many hours with this small device , limits your conscience and dirige all your mental reflexion in the virtual subject that you are seeing. As example, teenagers nowadays are addicted by social media, they make relations, share private photos anytime they want without control. Then, they see that is more easy to get information from media with smartphones without any request than discussing with family membres.</p>\n<p>However, the debat of smart technologies presents stark consequences, a middle ground can be found. Our life today presents many homes which are in different concept and for different reasons. Office is my home because my job, family is the other home because my family memberes, street is a home also because my friends, social media is the big home because i can find all of the pervious home but in remotly way not directly. From this view, i can say that we can't live alone but we shoud find a balanced model to succed our life in the many homes. Smartphone is one of pervasive device that facilitate and reliate all of these particular components for the humain. Thereby, to be up to date and help in the economic growth , we have to take time in practicing our hobbies and real life with membres directly simultanitly, getting researches and working remotly but in correctly way.</p>\n<p>In conclusion , we can say that the two goals of smat technogies exist but it is not impossible to find the safe way. The pervasive computing including smart environment, cities, sensors, internet, Iot which all are equiped by Smartphones, is crucial for economic growth and finding a harmonious balance in using them is the key of the progress of nations. The success of development depends to our ability to innovate in the positive way; So we shoud be moderate and manage correctly our using of social media by smarphones.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
