65	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:04:31.279	6.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\148\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 10:23:46", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Smartphones heve revolutionized the way we interact with the world around us, emboding a convergence of communication, information, and entrertainment tools, However their pervasive presence in our daily lives raises concerns about smartphone addiction and its ramifications for interpersonal relationships and professional environments.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
