67	122	\N	2024-12-23 11:49:29.694	31.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\26\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 09:39:15", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>The standard objection of A mericain action on climate chage is the argument that the United shouls take no action&nbsp;the developing world agrees to reduce greenhouse gas emissions.</p>\n<p>This argument rests on the fact that the United States cannot solve the problem of climate change by itself, and some nations in the developing world continue to contribute to the problem. If the United States acts and the developing world does not, so goes this argument, climate change will still happen and American industry will put itself at a competitive disadvantage.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Then, we have a&nbsp;special responsibilities to act before the poorer nations:&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
113	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:43:26.424	71.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\153\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 11:54:15", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The evolution of technology has changed and shaped the world in different ways. Let's take smartphones as an example. These devices have a great impact on communication, information availability and entertainement. However, using these devices can be addictive and harmful in terms of interpersonal relationships and professional environments. First,we are going to focus on how smarphones can be a blessing, then focus on how it can be a curse.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;On the first hand, social media played a big role on communication. Reaching a person with sending messages or making a call with just a simple click is very easy and accessible. We can say that distance and time factors are not a problem anymore to communicate with people. We can make friends using facebook or other social media platform. We also can reach our family member or friend who is abroad anytime we want and for free if you have internet connection.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;In addition, mobile applications include entertainment apps such us movie streaming apps, music and video games. If you are bored, just open Stream.io and watch a movie, if you are cleaning the house just open Spotify and listen to music to motivate you and if you want to spend some quality time with friends you can play an online mobile game like Among us and enjoy your time.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; On the other hand, scientists confirmed that social media and playing video games hit the brain with dopamine. Which can be addictive, similar to drug addiction. As a teacher, I can notice that students are always checking their phones in class which is leading to a lack of focus and interest in learning.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Moreover, introverts find their confort zone in isolating theirselves in their home since using a smartphone can make communicating with others easier as they do not need to go out, talk to other people face to face. This can worsen their condition, making them stay in their bubble without gaining social and emotional skills such as confidence and emotional intelligence.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;To conclude, smartphones can help us in our daily life but it also can destroy our brain, if we do not know to use it in a proper way. By making a time limit for using it, it can help us benefit from its advantages and control the dopamine doses. In addition, we should not rely only on virtual communication to make relationships and gain social skills, otherwise we will create a generation with zero social skills.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
